@? included Basics @|@|
@- Basics @

@<summary@=
Some common filters used by other modules.

- `evaluate`: executes the input as a script, the input must have a shebang,
              use the output of that script as the output.
@

@<evaluate@=#!/bin/sh
set -e
temp_file=`mktemp`
cat - > $temp_file
chmod +x $temp_file
$temp_file
rm $temp_file
@

@! included Basics @
@
